{% import "_shared.html.j2" as ui %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-PT">
<head>
{{ ui.head(direction, title, root) }}
<style>
:root { --display: "DM Serif Display", Georgia, serif; --text: "DM Sans", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif; --r: 26px; }
body { font: 400 17px/1.6 var(--text); }
a { color: var(--sea); text-underline-offset: 3px; }
h1, h2, h3 { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.1; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.005em; }
.wrap { max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 16px; }
.dir-bar { background: var(--surface); color: var(--muted); }
.dir-bar .here { color: var(--ink); }
.dir-bar button { border-color: var(--line); }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
.pill.coral { background: var(--button); color: var(--on-button); }
.pill.soft { background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
.pill.gone { background: var(--surface); color: var(--muted); border: 1px dashed var(--muted); }

/* Photo treatment: postcard corners + a warm sunset wash; text sits on a solid scrim. */
.photo { position: relative; border-radius: var(--r); overflow: hidden; background: var(--dusk); isolation: isolate; }
.photo img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
.photo::after { content: ""; position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; mix-blend-mode: soft-light;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(242, 165, 65, .55) 0%, rgba(214, 84, 47, .35) 55%, rgba(61, 44, 94, .55) 100%); }
.on-photo { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 1; color: #FFFFFF; background: var(--scrim); padding: 0 22px 20px; }
.on-photo::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: calc(100% - 1px); height: 70px;
  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, var(--scrim)); }
.on-photo a { color: #FFFFFF; }

.wave { display: block; width: 100%; height: 48px; }
.wave path { fill: var(--bg); }
.section { padding-block: 30px 44px; }
.section h2 { font-size: clamp(30px, 4.4vw, 46px); }
.section .intro { max-width: 60ch; margin: 10px 0 26px; color: var(--muted); }
.cta { display: inline-block; background: var(--button); color: var(--on-button); border-radius: 999px; padding: 14px 26px;
  font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
footer.foot { background: var(--surface); padding: 30px 0; }
footer.foot p { max-width: 75ch; margin: 0 0 10px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; }
footer.foot .brandline { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; font-family: var(--display); font-size: 26px; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 12px; }

.spec { background: var(--bg); }
.spec h2 { font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.spec h3 { font-size: 22px; margin: 22px 0 8px; }
.spec-kicker { color: var(--coral); font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 6px; }
.spec-rationale { max-width: 70ch; font-size: 18px; }
.spec-note, .spec li { font-size: 15px; }
.spec table { background: var(--surface); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; }
{% block style %}{% endblock %}
</style>
</head>
<body>
{{ ui.dir_bar(direction, page, root) }}
{% block body %}{% endblock %}
<footer class="foot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brandline">{{ ui.mark("sunset", 34) }} {{ brand.name }}</div>
    <p>{{ brand.tagline }} Viagens · Inspiração · Experiências.</p>
    <p>Mostramos preços que viajantes encontraram no Aviasales e que nós guardámos: {{ d.n_observations }} até hoje, em {{ d.n_routes }} rotas{% if d.first_seen %} desde {{ d.first_seen }}{% endif %}. Não são preços ao vivo e podem mudar. Horas de Lisboa · página gerada a {{ d.built_at }}.</p>
    <p class="disclosure">{{ disclosure }}</p>
  </div>
</footer>
{{ ui.spec(direction) }}
</body>
</html>
